<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka to overshoot '97 privatisation target.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka to overshoot '97 privatisation target.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka is confident of netting more than its budgeted revenue targets from privatisations in 1997, Mano Tittawella, director general of the Public Enterprise Reform Commission (PERC), said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;I am confident we will raise the five billion rupees needed to meet budgeted revenue targets in 1997, from plantation sector reforms and the sale of a few government minority holdings in companies,&quot; Tittawella told Reuters.</p>
</text>
